sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Admin
    participant M as Meraki cloud
    participant R as Your receiver
    Admin->>M: enable Scanning API: Post URL + secret + version
    M->>R: GET Post URL (validation)
    R-->>M: 200, body = validator string
    Note over M,R: URL validated, data starts flowing
    loop about every minute per AP
        M->>R: POST JSON {version, secret, type: WiFi or BLE, data}
        R->>R: check secret matches, store observations
        R-->>M: 2xx
    end
